id: pm-gfksc7
title: Assemble complete review receipts without mutating the base receipt
description: "Semgrep reports a nonblocking insecure-object-assign pattern in the review watcher. Static source-policy triage is not_actionable with high confidence: the GitHub head identifier is a value under a fixed receipt key and readiness signals have fixed locally constructed top-level keys. There is no attacker-controlled property-name assignment or privileged model sink. Clarify complete receipt assembly with a fresh result object while preserving every serialized receipt field, superseded attempt and fail-fast behavior; let the unchanged scanner reevaluate the pattern."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[2]: quality,tooling
created_at: "2026-10-19T21:27:15.167Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-19T21:40:54.655Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-19T21:30:16.035Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-19T21:30:16.035Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 20
acceptance_criteria: Complete receipts preserve all existing fields and outcome behavior; Superseded head/base attempts remain in order; Existing watcher/publisher regression coverage remains green; No scanner suppression or security-policy weakening is introduced; The report is documented as a static false positive rather than a confirmed vulnerability fix
parent: pm-obq2
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "Replace mutation of the base watch receipt with a fresh complete receipt in the same attempt slot. Preserve every serialized field, outcome, pending/unavailable signal, publisher requirement and superseded-attempt history. Record the reported assignment pattern as a statically defeated mass-assignment claim rather than a confirmed vulnerability."
expected_result: Watch output and failure behavior stay compatible while receipt ownership is explicit and the unchanged scanner can reassess the pattern.
actual_result: "All17 existing regressions pass, including complete readiness and superseded histories. Focused coverage is exact100/100/100/100 across238 statements187 branches54 functions207 lines. Linked checks, strict ESLint and syntax validation pass. SDK runtime code tests workflows and dependency manifests remain unchanged from accepted native source dd097e4e1; hosted rescanning is the final report-resolution check."
