comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-19T21:27:15.167Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: full207 open and0 active records with zero omissions plus report-specific search show no live owner for this review-helper pattern. Full closed pm-jm7m3o and its complete history were read; shipped failure visibility remains completed. The imported report is statically defeated before public maintenance intake, consistent with the security policy distinction for non-security improvements."
  "2026-10-19T21:30:12.525Z","harness:codex","Static-only triage of the reported receipt assignment is not_actionable with high confidence. The external head value stays under the fixed watchedHeadRefOid key; readiness functions construct fixed mergeReadiness/pendingChecks/unavailableChecks fields, and no arbitrary property names reach a privileged target. Prefer a fresh complete receipt stored in the same attempt position for clearer ownership. All17 existing watch/publisher tests pass with exact scoped coverage238 statements187 branches54 functions207 lines, all100 percent; strict ESLint and syntax validation pass. Linked verification records the same unchanged behavior cohort. No scanner suppression, rule disablement or vulnerability-fix claim is used."
  "2026-10-19T21:40:54.650Z","harness:codex",Chrome also confirms the project-scoped refs/heads/main Open code-finding view has no matching findings. The organization-wide count is not attributed to this repository. PR1508 has the one statically defeated assignment-pattern report already assessed here; revised source will be rescanned without any manual ignore or rule change.
